<title>FRANCE: Havas, GBL, Bertelsmann agree TV merger.</title>
<headline>Havas, GBL, Bertelsmann agree TV merger.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French media group Havas, Belgian holding company Groupe Bruxelles Lambert and Germany's Bertelsmann have approved the merger of their CLT and UFA satellite television operations, Havas said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
